[[ch01-getting-started]]
== Getting Started

This chapter is about getting started with Git. We will begin by explaining some background on version control tools—through the eyes of Nora, our UX Lead—then move on to how to get Git running on your system and finally how to get it set up to start working with. At the end of this chapter, you should understand why Git is essential for design projects, why you should use it, and you should be all set up to do so.

